### Generate a task with AI
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Create an Java task to reverse a string array, accept array with some words and return array reversed",
  "decision": "CONTINUE"
}

### List published tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Get a task
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json

### Review a generated draft with AI
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/review
Accept: application/json

### Get a progressive task hint
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/hints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": 1
}

### Publish a task
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/publish
Accept: application/json

### Reject a task
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/reject
Accept: application/json

### Check for similar tasks before generation
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Write a function to reverse a string."
}

### Reindex task embeddings
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/embeddings/reindex
Accept: application/json

### Continue generation after reviewing similar-task warnings
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Create a medium Java task about finding the longest substring without repeating characters using a sliding window",
  "decision": "CONTINUE"
}

### Search solutions by approach
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/solutions?query=iterative%20sliding%20window&limit=5
Accept: application/json
